<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:43:43 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>出差与同事晚餐后吃甜点</title><link>https://some.pics/6afbb14b3152d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;出差途中，晚饭后和同事一起吃了甜点！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A tin bowl with a brownie ice cream sundae. " height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/azaleah/6afbb14b3152d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://azaleah.some.pics"&gt;@azaleah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:43:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>四年前的今日照片</title><link>https://some.pics/6afb7810d4849</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;四年前今天的照片。通过&lt;a href="https://flohgro.com/onthisday/"&gt;On This Day&lt;/a&gt;找到的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A blue sky stretches over a layered expanse of clouds, with a tall, dark cloud rising in the center and a pinkish glow visible in the distance." height="3840" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/flohgro/6afb7810d4849.jpg" width="2880"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://flohgro.some.pics"&gt;@flohgro&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:39:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>记录咒语笔记</title><link>https://some.pics/6afb6bd46536f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;做一些笔记可以帮助你记住你的咒语工作。制作护身符后，你可以写下你使用了什么以及为什么选择它。当你想再做一个时，你就有那些细节可以回顾。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy illustration of a witch writing beside a rose-ribbon charm and sleeping cat at a wooden desk, with supply shelves, charcoal walls, rose curtains, and an arched mountain-view window. Ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold botanical mountain emblem sits at bottom-right. Text: A few notes can help you remember your spellwork. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afb6bd46536f.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:47:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>照片效果出乎意料</title><link>https://some.pics/6afb42690f22b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;……当照片呈现的结果与预期不同时&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The shadow of the photographer,  aka myself on a grey house wall. I am holding a mobile phone above my head with both arms to take a photograph of the shadow play on the wall. The shadow shows undergrowth within the bright square cast by a car’s headlight. At the moment the photograph is taken, a car came from behind and illuminated the scene. Next to this, a road with streetlights and buildings can be vaguely made out. " height="2918" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6afb42690f22b.jpg" width="3739"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:50:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>色彩更丰富的非森林景致</title><link>https://some.pics/6afafe15ea0b9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;不是森林，但它的色彩变化更丰富一些&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="an open road that has an island separating the lanes. the island has trees on it and there's trees along the curbs in various shades of green, yellow, and red" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6afafe15ea0b9.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:59:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11月16日牌运指引</title><link>https://some.pics/6afae8652f4f3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日记本 · 2026年11月16日
读牌：梅花杰克
有利焦点：为停滞的项目揭示可行的替代方案；为家庭困难争取实际支持；与有帮助的合作者建立联系
包含支持性时机窗口。

日记本：https://mizjeannie.com/daybook&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Daybook for November 16, 2026: an illustrated Jack of Clubs, the daily reading, three favored magical focuses and their supporting timing windows." height="1600" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afae8652f4f3.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:26:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日对应：11月16日</title><link>https://some.pics/6afae3960e140</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日对应 — 2026年11月16日&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;靛蓝 · 紫水晶 · 艾蒿&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在米兹·珍妮的网站上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 16, 2026. Color: Indigo — divination, discernment, inner-work, dreams. Crystal: Amethyst — divination, temperance, protection, spiritual insight. Herb: Mugwort (Artemisia vulgaris) — divination, dreams, protection, intuition. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afae3960e140.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:06:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>尊重室友的巫术实践</title><link>https://some.pics/6afa6e79c6d18</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的巫术可以尊重与你同住的人。如果室友不喜欢熏香，你可以不点燃任何东西而说出祝福。这种调整体现了对你自己的修行和你们共同居所的关怀。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy cottage interior in charcoal and muted rose, with a witch blessing an open doorway beside a comfortably reading housemate. Lily-pad stepping stones cross blue-green water toward a cottage on a giant lily pad. Ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: Your witchcraft can respect the people you live with. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afa6e79c6d18.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:46:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日天空</title><link>https://some.pics/6afa4243b6d9d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今日天空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Light wispy clouds streaking across a pale blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6afa4243b6d9d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:37:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>暗眼灯草鹀</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9fbc34c24b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只暗眼灯草鹀。我以前从未见过这些，不得不查了一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A dark gray bird with a white chest and white beak" height="1280" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af9fbc34c24b.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:36:54 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>